<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ritualRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The functional governance role this authority occupies."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#RitualRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-editor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-authority> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-translator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The person who rendered the text from one language into another. The source and target languages should be recorded on the associated iroko:TextContent instance using iroko:textLanguage."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-authority> .
