<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorityType-divinatory-office> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Authority vested in a specific divinatory office — Babalawo, Oluwo, Houngan Asogwe, etc. — rather than the individual holder."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-authority> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Iroko Framework: Authority Module"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#jurisdiction-cap-haitien> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#jurisdictionLabel> "Cap-Haitien"@en .
