<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasContributorRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorityType-divinatory-office> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AuthorityType> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorityType-house> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Authority vested in a religious house (ile, sosyete, cabildo house, etc.)."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#culturalFrame> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Short label for the tradition frame within which this authority operates. Example: Lucumi, Palo, Espiritismo, Vodou, Candomble. Use iroko:tradition for linked-data-typed values."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-hereditary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Authority derives from family lineage independent of formal consecration or appointment."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AuthorityBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What the authority rests on: lineage succession, consecration, appointment, community recognition, divinatory selection, or other basis."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#jurisdiction-galveston> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Jurisdiction> .
