<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Jurisdiction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jurisdiction"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-patron> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A person who provided financial, political, or institutional support enabling the production or survival of the manuscript or the transmission of the tradition. The patron may or may not have directly commissioned the work — patronage may be ongoing rather than project-specific."@en .
