<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-scribe> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The person who physically copied or wrote the text. Distinguished from the intellectual author (originator of the content) and from the translator. In manuscript traditions, the scribe is often the most directly documented contributor."@en .
