<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-commissioner> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A person who formally ordered or commissioned the production of this specific manuscript or the performance of this specific ceremony or text. Distinguished from patron by the directness and specificity of the commissioning relationship."@en .
