<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Authority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A jurisdictional authority capable of authorizing assertion-level claims and governance decisions. May represent a lineage, cabildo, religious house, elder council, or recognized individual in a governance role. Extends the iroko:RitualAuthority stub in Core. For the individual's held credential (title, office), see ile:ReligiousOffice."@en .
