<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-publisher> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A person or institution responsible for the formal publication or release of the work. Applies primarily to printed materials; for manuscripts, use commissioner or patron."@en .
