<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-hereditary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hereditary"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-community-recognition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Authority derives from informal but sustained community acknowledgment."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-divinatory-selection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AuthorityBasis> .
