<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#culturalFrame> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorityBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Authority> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-consecration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Authority derives from a ritual consecration event."@en .
