<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorityBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "authority basis"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-bookseller> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A person involved in the commercial sale or distribution of the manuscript or printed work. Documents the commercial networks through which manuscripts traveled."@en .
