<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-artist> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ContributorRole> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-authority> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorityType-divinatory-office> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Divinatory Office"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-community-delegate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Person acting in an authorized representative capacity on behalf of a house or community."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-contrib-bookseller> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ContributorRoleScheme> .
